# BildyApp — Dashboard endpoint
# Requires VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)

@base  = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = <paste_your_token_here>

### Get dashboard summary
# Returns:
#   totals          — total counts for clients, projects, delivery notes, signed notes
#   notesByMonth    — delivery notes per month for the last 12 months (total vs signed)
#   hoursByProject  — top 10 projects by hours logged
#   materialsByClient — top 10 clients by number of material notes
#   recentNotes     — 5 most recently created delivery notes
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health check (no auth required)
GET {{base}}/../health
